==Specials==
====Raimei Zan====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|name=Raimei Zan
|moveId=dong_214B,dong_214D,dong_214BD
|input=214B/D/BD
|description3=
* Can be done as a feint with 2DRev.
* Beats Lows.
* Light version hits mid and isn't a true blockstring.
* Heavy version is unsafe most of the time.
* All versions can be braked.
** Heavy, Rev and Feint versions give you enough height to do j214BD or Super Dong Kick.
Amazing mix tool, key part of Dong's gameplan, be it the move on its own or by braking it. On counter he gets a full combo from any version. The main risk comes from the fact it can be mashed out of or DPed if the opponent knows what to do.
}}

